<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Soriana 9-mo net falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Soriana 9-mo net falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Oper Income     346.87 million	     250.42 million</p>
<p>	Net Profit	413.26 million	     475.25 million</p>
